<title>USA: International Equity stock sale off.</title>
<headline>International Equity stock sale off.</headline>
<dateline>FLOSSMOOR, Ill. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Equity Resources Inc said Friday that Kyoto Securities Ltd has decided not to purchase the 20 million shares of International Equity it had agreed to buy in February.  </p>
<p>No reason was given for the decision, International Equity said.  The company said it has not decided what steps it will take.</p>
<p>In February, Internaitonal Equity said it agreed to sell the shares to Kyoto for $20 million.  International Equity has 25 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
